  "system": {
    "description": "<p>When you enter danger aboard a vehicle, you gain <strong>+1 impact</strong> for vehicle speed and maneuverability and you don&rsquo;t suffer a worse position when moving around on the outside of a high-speed vehicle. Your vehicles gain <strong>armor</strong>.<br><em>This means that all sorts of vehicle maneuvers which might ordinarily be </em><em>desperate&mdash;jumping from one rover to another, crawling along the outside of a </em><em>dropjet, etc.&mdash;are more likely to be risky. Any vehicles which already have armor </em><em>gain an additional armor box.</em></p>",
